  "note": "OSV lists no fix commit; these came from the 4.1.131 to 4.1.132 jar diff. Zero-byte CONTINUATION frames get past the size checks; the fix adds a limit on small CONTINUATION frames and changes verifyContinuationFrame and HeadersBlockBuilder.addFragment. Present in 4.1.42, 4.1.100, 4.1.131 and 4.2.6, and under the io.grpc.netty.shaded prefix in grpc-netty-shaded 1.50.0 and 1.70.0. Any HTTP/2 server built on Netty reaches these.",
